<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charSet="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/images/ThePoolLab.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="https://www.pentair.com/content/dam/extranet/nam/pentair-pool/residential/cleaners/prowler-cleaners/prowler-910/prowler-910-images/Prowler910-front-whtRT_cr_rez.png.thumb.1280.1280.jpg"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="stylesheet" href="/_next/static/css/0fc6c400c3ed5371.css" crossorigin="" data-precedence="next"/><link rel="preload" as="script" fetchPriority="low" href="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin=""/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/fd9d1056-4dbbcf07a05c3f48.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/472-6eced84fcf03e6a3.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/main-app-ce281d8555633725.js" async="" crossorigin=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/326-bff252670b7455ef.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/413-e7f375c310822fe5.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/reviews/%5Bsku%5D/page-158ca34b840e43ec.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/975-95592eb349967368.js" async=""></script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/app/layout-4ee2f436a51b65f2.js" async=""></script><title>Pentair Prowler 930 Review - The Pool Lab</title><meta name="description" content="A high-speed scrubbing robotic cleaner with all-surface deep cleaning and a top-access filtration basket."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/reviews/Pentair-Prowler-930"/><meta property="og:title" content="Pentair Prowler 930 Review"/><meta property="og:description" content="A high-speed scrubbing robotic cleaner with all-surface deep cleaning and a top-access filtration basket."/><meta property="og:image" content="https://www.pentair.com/content/dam/extranet/nam/pentair-pool/residential/cleaners/prowler-cleaners/prowler-910/prowler-910-images/Prowler910-front-whtRT_cr_rez.png.thumb.1280.1280.jpg"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="The Pool Lab - Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Your ultimate guide to Robot Pool Cleaners, reviews, and maintenance tips."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://www.the-pool-lab.com/images/ThePoolLabOG.png"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-c67a75d1b6f99dc8.js" crossorigin="" noModule=""></script></head><body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100"><nav class="navbar navbar-expand-lg navbar-light bg-light"><div class="container"><a class="navbar-brand d-flex align-items-center" href="/"><div style="width:160px;height:90px;position:relative;margin-right:10px"><img src="/images/ThePoolLab.png" alt="The Pool Lab Logo" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain"/></div><span class="d-none d-sm-inline">The Pool Lab</span></a><button class="navbar-toggler" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#navbarNav"><span class="navbar-toggler-icon"></span></button><div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbarNav"><ul class="navbar-nav ms-auto"><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/">Home</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/reviews">Reviews</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/best-of">Best of</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/guides">Guides</a></li><li class="nav-item"><a class="nav-link" href="/about">About</a></li></ul></div></div></nav><main class="flex-grow-1"><div class="container my-5"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-8"><h1 class="mb-3">Pentair Prowler 930<!-- -->: In-Depth Review</h1><div class="text-center mb-4 p-3 bg-white rounded border" style="height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><img src="https://www.pentair.com/content/dam/extranet/nam/pentair-pool/residential/cleaners/prowler-cleaners/prowler-910/prowler-910-images/Prowler910-front-whtRT_cr_rez.png.thumb.1280.1280.jpg" alt="Pentair Prowler 930" class="img-fluid" style="max-height:100%;max-width:100%;object-fit:contain;width:auto;height:auto"/></div><p class="lead">The Pentair Prowler 930 is essentially a re-badged Dolphin S300i (built by Maytronics for Pentair), which is fantastic news. It means you get the legendary Dolphin cleaning performance and reliability backed by the massive support network of Pentair. It is a premium robot with Bluetooth control, multi-layer filtration, and a caddy included.</p><h3 class="mt-5">Who This Is For</h3><div><p>The Prowler 930 is perfect for:</p><ul><li><strong>Pentair loyalists</strong> who want a robot that matches their equipment pad.</li><li>Owners who want <strong>smart control</strong> via Bluetooth.</li><li>Those who need <strong>multi-layer filtration</strong> (fine and ultra-fine).</li><li>Anyone who wants a complete package with a caddy.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Who Should Skip It</h3><div><p>Think twice if:</p><ul><li><strong>You are on a budget:</strong> You pay a premium for the Pentair name and the included accessories.</li><li><strong>You don't need the caddy:</strong> You can get similar performance from the Dolphin Nautilus Titan for less.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Key Features</h3><div><ul><li><strong>PowerStream Mobility:</strong> Superior waterline scrubbing and navigation.</li><li><strong>Multi-Layer Filtration:</strong> Captures large and fine debris simultaneously.</li><li><strong>Bluetooth Connectivity:</strong> App control for scheduling and steering.</li><li><strong>Premium Caddy Included:</strong> Easy transport and storage.</li><li><strong>Active Scrubbing:</strong> High-speed front brush.</li></ul></div><h3 class="mt-5">Detailed Analysis</h3><div><p><strong>Dolphin DNA:</strong> Because it's built on the Maytronics S-Series platform, the Prowler 930 shares the excellent PowerStream mobility system. This allows it to move laterally along the waterline and scrub aggressively. It is fast, efficient, and rarely gets stuck.</p><p><strong>Multi-Layer Filtration:</strong> The basket includes both rough and ultra-fine filters nested together. This allows it to capture leaves and fine silt in a single pass without clogging. It's one of the best filtration systems on the market.</p><p><strong>Smart Control:</strong> You can control the Prowler 930 via the Pentair Home app (Bluetooth). This lets you drive the robot for spot cleaning and set delayed starts. It's a convenient feature for tech-forward pool owners.</p></div><div class="row mt-4"><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-success h-100"><div class="card-header bg-success text-white">Pros</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Top-tier cleaning performance (Dolphin tech)</li><li class="list-group-item">Excellent multi-layer filtration system</li><li class="list-group-item">Includes a high-quality caddy</li><li class="list-group-item">Bluetooth app control is useful</li><li class="list-group-item">Backed by Pentair&#x27;s support network</li></ul></div></div><div class="col-md-6"><div class="card border-danger h-100"><div class="card-header bg-danger text-white">Cons</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item">Expensive compared to similar Dolphin models</li><li class="list-group-item">Bluetooth range is limited</li><li class="list-group-item">No swivel on the cable</li><li class="list-group-item">App can be finicky to pair</li></ul></div></div></div><h3 class="mt-5">Final Verdict</h3><p>The Pentair Prowler 930 is a luxury robot that delivers luxury results. It takes the proven mechanics of the Dolphin S-Series and packages it with Pentair branding and a full accessory kit. If you want a complete, high-performance cleaning solution and don&#x27;t mind paying for the best, the Prowler 930 is an outstanding choice.</p></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="card sticky-top" style="top:20px"><div class="card-body text-center"><h5 class="card-title">Pentair Prowler 930</h5><p class="card-text">Ready to buy? Get the best price online.</p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N7IZSZJ?tag=scorpiusllc-20" target="_blank" class="btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 ">Check Price on Amazon</a><small class="text-muted d-block mt-2">We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.</small></div><div class="card mt-4"><div class="card-header bg-light fw-bold">Consider These Alternatives</div><ul class="list-group list-group-flush"><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Dolphin-Nautilus-Titan">Dolphin Nautilus Titan</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1599</span></li><li class="list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center"><a class="text-decoration-none fw-bold" href="/reviews/Polaris-9650iQ-Sport">Polaris 9650iQ Sport</a><span class="badge bg-secondary rounded-pill">$<!-- -->1099</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></main><footer class="bg-dark text-white text-center py-3 mt-auto"><div class="container"><p class="mb-1">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->The Pool Lab<!-- -->. All rights reserved.</p><small class="text-white-50">The Pool Lab<!-- --> is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com.</small></div></footer><script src="/_next/static/chunks/webpack-9104c05f1a1687bc.js" crossorigin="" async=""></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0]);self.__next_f.push([2,null])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"1:HL[\"/_next/static/css/d071dca61fbb01bf.css\",\"style\",{\"crossOrigin\":\"\"}]\n2:HL[\"/_next/static/css/