 mobility system. This allows it to move laterally along the waterline and scrub aggressively. It is fast, efficient, and rarely gets stuck.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMulti-Layer Filtration:\u003c/strong\u003e The basket includes both rough and ultra-fine filters nested together. This allows it to capture leaves and fine silt in a single pass without clogging. It's one of the best filtration systems on the market.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSmart Control:\u003c/strong\u003e You can control the Prowler 930 via the Pentair Home app (Bluetooth). This lets you drive the robot for spot cleaning and set delayed starts. It's a convenient feature for tech-forward pool owners.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Top-tier cleaning performance (Dolphin tech)\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Excellent multi-layer filtration system\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Includes a high-quality caddy\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Bluetooth app control is useful\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Backed by Pentair's support network\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",